					</div>
					
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="zh-Hant-TW" dir="ltr"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r88027378">.mw-parser-output .mbox-text,.mw-parser-output .mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.9em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .mbox-image{border:none;padding:2px 0 2px 0.9em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .mbox-imageright{border:none;padding:2px 0.9em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r94488332">.mw-parser-output .ambox{border:1px solid #a2a9b1;border-left:10px solid #36c;background-color:#fbfbfb;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox,.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox,.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox{margin-top:-1px}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small-left{margin:4px 1em 4px 0;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}.mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{border-left:10px solid #b32424;background-color:#fee7e6}.mw-parser-output .ambox-delete{border-left:10px solid #b32424}.mw-parser-output .ambox-content{border-left:10px solid #f28500}.mw-parser-output .ambox-style{border-left:10px solid #fc3}.mw-parser-output .ambox-move{border-left:10px solid #9932cc}.mw-parser-output .ambox-protection{border-left:10px solid #a2a9b1}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image{border:none;padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-imageright{border:none;padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:52px}@media(min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:0 10%}}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .ambox{display:none!important}}</style><table class="box-Lead&#95;too&#95;short plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content ambox-lead&#95;too&#95;short" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Wiki_letter_w.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Wiki_letter_w.svg/40px-Wiki_letter_w.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Wiki_letter_w.svg/120px-Wiki_letter_w.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="44" data-file-height="44" /></a></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目<b><a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8A/%E5%BA%8F%E8%A8%80%E7%AB%A0%E7%AF%80" title="Wikipedia:格式手冊/序言章節">序言章節</a>沒有充分<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F" title="Wikipedia:摘要格式">總結</a>全文內容要點</b>。<span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2014年9月1日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>請考慮擴充序言，<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8A/%E5%BA%8F%E8%A8%80%E7%AB%A0%E7%AF%80#提供易讀的總覽" title="Wikipedia:格式手冊/序言章節">清晰概述</a>條目所有重點。請在條目的<a href="/wiki/Talk:%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A" title="Talk:紳士階級">討論頁</a>討論此問題。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r88027378" /><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r94488332" /><table class="box-Refimprove plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Tango-nosources.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/60px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="45" height="45" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/120px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" /></a></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目<b>需要補充更多<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:列明來源">來源</a></b>。<span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2011年2月1日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>請協助補充多方面<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:可靠來源">可靠來源</a>以<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A&amp;action=edit">改善這篇條目</a>，<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81" class="mw-redirect" title="Wikipedia:可供查證">無法查證</a>的內容可能會因為<a href="/wiki/Template:Fact" class="mw-redirect" title="Template:Fact">異議提出</a>而被移除。<br />致使用者：請搜尋一下條目的標題（來源搜尋：<span class="plainlinks"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?&amp;as_eq=wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A%22">"紳士階級"</a> &#8212; <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?q=%22%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A%22">網頁</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=&amp;as_src=-newswire+-wire+-presswire+-PR+-press+-release+-wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A%22">新聞</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//books.google.com/books?&amp;as_brr=0&amp;as_pub=-icon&amp;q=%22%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A%22">書籍</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//scholar.google.com/scholar?&amp;q=%22%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A%22">學術</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;safe=off&amp;q=%22%E7%B4%B3%E5%A3%AB%E9%9A%8E%E7%B4%9A%22">圖像</a></span>），以檢查網路上是否存在該主題的更多可靠來源（<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:可靠來源">判定指引</a>）。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
